  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food and Agriculture Organization of the United Nations (FAO) Support for Small Farmers Affected by drought</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Food and Agriculture Organization of the United Nations (FAO) Support for Small Farmers Affected by drought is a component of Humanitarian Response to Food Insecurity in Lesotho 2012/2013 reported by FCDO with a funding type of 105 -  Humanitarian assistance and a budget of &#xA3;1,000,000. It works in the following sector(s): Immediate post-emergency reconstruction and rehabilitation, Disaster prevention and preparedness, Relief co-ordination and support services.</narrative>
  </description>
